  subheaderText: 'SECTOR 7 POWER PLANT REPORT: MINOR INCIDENT CONTAINED'
  descriptionText: A small technical fault at Sector 7 caused a temporary pressure release. Claims of dangerous radiation are unverified rumors, and spreading panic remains illegal under emergency code. Light atmospheric haze poses no threat, and daily operations continue as normal.
